en:
//　急激な荷重が全身を襲う。
//　しかし構ってなどいられない。
  I snap into a hard turn. My vision blurs as G-forces smash my brain against the side of my skull.

//　避けきれるか――――？
  Will we make it in time!?

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mc01/011vs0150a00'>
//「ずああああっ!!」
"GAHHHHHH!"

//　左足を……<RUBY text='・・・・'>抉られた</RUBY>！
//　肉をごっそりと奪われたのがわかる。
  Pain surges up my spine as something tears through my left leg, taking armor, flesh, and bone with it.

//　思わず寒気が走るほどの喪失感。
//　だが、危ういところで直撃だけは避けた……。
  The agony is compounded by the chilling knowledge that part of me is gone. I'm just lucky the leg's still attached―and that we avoided a direct hit.
